||The hero of the [[Mushroom Kingdom]] and the game's protagonist. ''Super Mario Odyssey'' has Mario going on a world voyage to stop the forced marital union between [[Princess Peach]] and [[Bowser]]. Mario's advanced movement options from ''[[Super Mario 64]]'' and ''[[Super Mario Sunshine]]'' return alongside completely new abilities. Many of these involve his new traveling companion, Cappy.
