|A white [[Bonneter]] that resembles a top hat. He joins Mario on his journey to help rescue his sister Tiara, who was also kidnapped by Bowser. Cappy takes on the form of [[Mario Cap|Mario's cap]] during the game and can be tossed at characters and objects, allowing Mario to temporarily [[capture]] them and use their abilities. In multiplayer, the second player controls Cappy while the first controls Mario, somewhat similar to how multiplayer worked with the [[Co-Star Luma]] in ''[[Super Mario Galaxy 2]]''.
