|[[File:SMO Art - Wedding Peach.png|100x100px]]<br>[[Princess Peach]]
|The ruler of the Mushroom Kingdom. She is kidnapped by [[Bowser]], who aims to {{wp|Forced marriage|force her into marriage}}. The game's story revolves around [[Mario]]'s quest to stop the marriage and save her. The two are [[Princess Peach#Friends and love interests|very close]]. Once Peach is rescued, Mario attempts to {{wp|Marriage proposal|propose}} to her himself before being interrupted by Bowser, leading to both being rejected. After returning home, she gifts hats to all of her subjects and pursues her own worldwide voyage with Tiara. Peach can be found in revisited kingdoms, and she gives Mario a [[Power Moon]] once spoken to.
|All kingdoms except the [[Dark Side]] and [[Darker Side]]
|-
|[[File:SMO Artwork Tiara.png|100x100px]]<br>[[Tiara]]
|Cappy's younger sister. She is kidnapped by Bowser and forced to serve as Peach's bridal veil. She develops a bond with Peach while captured, and they decide to travel the world together once rescued.
|All kingdoms except the [[Dark Side]] and [[Darker Side]]
