|[[File:SMO Artwork Tostarenan (Blue).png|75x75px]][[File:SMO Artwork Tostarenan (Green).png|75x75px]]<br>[[Tostarenan]]s
|The music-loving people of [[Sand Kingdom|Tostarena]]. Bowser indirectly burdens them with a cold snap when he steals their [[Binding Band]]. Tostarenans look like {{wp|calavera}}s and wear sombreros to keep the sun out of their eyes, which they also sell to tourists. Some dance to the rhythm of nearby music, shaking their maracas. [[Slots]] are run by Tosterenans across several kingdoms. They are related to the [[Chincho]] enemies that roam the desert at night. The [[Desert Wanderer]] is a Tostarenan.
