|Koopas are turtle-like creatures. Some host a game called [[Koopa Trace-Walking|Trace-Walking]]. They reward Mario with a Power Moon if he successfully follows the disappearing route they lay out on the surrounding ground. Each Trace-Walking host is a different color and wears a hat tied to the visited kingdom. Though members of the [[Koopa clan|Koopa family]], Trace-Walking Koopas are harmless and seem to be unaffiliated with Bowser.
