*A scene of Mario fighting Bowser from this game, accompanied by "[[Castle BGM (Super Mario Bros.)|Castle BGM]]", is visible when Mario captures Bowser.
*With its sunglasses on, a Moe-Eye sometimes hums the first few notes of "[[Ground BGM (Super Mario Bros.)|Ground BGM]]" and "[[Ending (Super Mario Bros.)|Ending]]" from this game while walking around.
